OL,3,GNEWSA'I was a bedbound ME sufferer, but
OL,4,AI can offer hope'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Leatherhead who spent a
OL,7,Fdecade bedbound with chronic fatigue
OL,8,Fsyndrome said he is "learning how to
OL,9,Finteract with the world again".
OL,11,FMyalgic encephalomyelitis/chronic
OL,12,Ffatigue syndrome (ME/CFS) is a
OL,13,Fcondition which causes fatigue, sleep
OL,14,Fdisturbance, cognitive difficulties,
OL,15,Fheadaches, nausea and intolerance to
OL,16,Flights and noise.
OL,18,FKieran Barnaville, who is among the
OL,19,F404,000 people the ME Association
OL,20,Festimates have the condition, spent
OL,21,Fyears unable to speak or leave his bed
OL,22,Fas a teenager.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
