OL,3,GNEWSA'I was a bedbound ME sufferer, but
OL,4,AI can offer hope'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 23-year-old, who deteriorated after
OL,7,Fcontracting glandular fever during a
OL,8,Frugby tour, said "everything shut down"
OL,9,Fas he felt "trapped inside" his own
OL,10,Fbody.
